ions\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-quality-dimensions/\"><span>13</span><span data-bn=\"Data Quality Dimension\" data-en=\"Data Quality Dimensions\">Data Quality Dimensions</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"missing-duplicate-invalid-and-outlier-values\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/missing-duplicate-invalid-and-outlier-values/\"><span>14</span><span data-bn=\"Missing, Duplicate, Invalid ও Outlier Value\" data-en=\"Missing, Duplicate, Invalid, and Outlier Values\">Missing, Duplicate, Invalid, and Outlier Values</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"tidy-data-and-organization\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/tidy-data-and-organization/\"><span>15</span><span data-bn=\"Tidy Data ও Data Organization\" data-en=\"Tidy Data and Data Organization\">Tidy Data and Data Organization</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"frequency-tables-and-summary-views\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/frequency-tables-and-summary-views/\"><span>16</span><span data-bn=\"Frequency Table ও Summary View\" data-en=\"Frequency Tables and Summary Views\">Frequency Tables and Summary Views</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"analytical-questions-and-metrics\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/analytical-questions-and-metrics/\"><span>17</span><span data-bn=\"Analytical Question ও Metric Definition\" data-en=\"Analytical Questions and Defining Metrics\">Analytical Questions and Defining Metrics</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"exploratory-data-analysis-workflow\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/exploratory-data-analysis-workflow/\"><span>18</span><span data-bn=\"Exploratory Data Analysis Workflow\" data-en=\"Exploratory Data Analysis Workflow\">Exploratory Data Analysis Workflow</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"reproducible-analysis-and-documentation\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/reproducible-analysis-and-documentation/\"><span>19</span><span data-bn=\"Reproducible Analysis ও Documentation\" data-en=\"Reproducible Analysis and Documentation\">Reproducible Analysis and Documentation</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"data-ethics-privacy-and-responsible-use\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-ethics-privacy-and-responsible-use/\"><span>20</span><span data-bn=\"Data Ethics, Privacy ও Responsible Use\" data-en=\"Data Ethics, Privacy, and Responsible Use\">Data Ethics, Privacy, and Responsible Use</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"mini-project-retail-data-audit\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/mini-project-retail-data-audit/\"><span>21</span><span data-bn=\"Mini Project: Retail Dataset Audit\" data-en=\"Mini Project: Audit a Retail Dataset\">Mini Project: Audit a Retail Dataset</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a></div></nav>\n<div class=\"tutorial-sidebar-links\"><a href=\"/exercises/data-foundations/\">Exercises</a><a href=\"/quiz/data-foundations/\">Final quiz</a><a href=\"/examples/data-foundations/\">Examples</a><a href=\"/references/data-foundations/\">References</a></div>\n</aside>\n<div class=\"tutorial-drawer-backdrop\" id=\"tutorial-drawer-backdrop\"></div>\n<article class=\"tutorial-content\" data-chapter=\"rows-columns-tables-and-datasets\" data-tutorial=\"data-foundations\">\n<header class=\"tutorial-page-header\"><div>\n<span class=\"eyebrow\" data-bn=\"Data Foundations · Chapter 4 / 21\" data-en=\"Data Foundations · Chapter 4 of 21\">Data Foundations · Chapter 4 of 21</span>\n<h1 data-bn=\"Row, Column, Table ও Dataset\" data-en=\"Rows, Columns, Tables, and Datasets\">Rows, Columns, Tables, and Datasets</h1>\n<p class=\"tutorial-lead\" data-bn=\"Analytical data rectangular table, related table, file ও dataset-এ কীভাবে organize হয় এবং structure কেন answerable question নির্ধারণ করে তা শিখুন।\" data-en=\"Understand how analytical data is organized into rectangular tables, related tables, files, and datasets—and why structure determines what questions can be answered.\">Understand how analytical data is organized into rectangular tables, related tables, files, and datasets—and why structure determines what questions can be answered.</p>\n</div><div class=\"tutorial-header-actions\"><button class=\"button ghost tutorial-drawer-open\" id=\"tutorial-drawer-open\" type=\"button\">☰ <span data-bn=\"Chapter\" data-en=\"Chapters\">Chapters</span></button><button class=\"button ghost\" onclick=\"window.print()\" type=\"button\">⎙ <span data-bn=\"Print\" data-en=\"Print\">Print</span></button></div></header>\n<div class=\"chapter-meta\"><span>◷ 40 min</span><span>Beginner</span><button class=\"button small primary\" id=\"chapter-complete\" type=\"button\">Mark complete</button></div>\n<nav aria-label=\"On this chapter\" class=\"chapter-jump\"><a href=\"#objectives\">Objectives</a><a href=\"#concept-1\">Learn</a><a href=\"#worked-example\">Example</a><a href=\"#try-it\">Try it</a><a href=\"#exercises\">Exercises</a><a href=\"#summary\">Summary</a></nav>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section tutorial-objectives\" id=\"objectives\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Start here</div><h2 data-bn=\"আপনি যা শিখবেন\" data-en=\"What you will learn\">What you will learn</h2><ul><li><span data-bn=\"Row, column, table ও dataset explain করুন।\" data-en=\"Explain rows, columns, tables, and datasets.\">Explain rows, columns, tables, and datasets.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Well-structured analytical table চিনুন।\" data-en=\"Recognize a well-structured analytical table.\">Recognize a well-structured analytical table.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Single table ও multi-table dataset আলাদা করুন।\" data-en=\"Distinguish a single table from a multi-table dataset.\">Distinguish a single table from a multi-table dataset.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Common structural problem identify করুন।\" data-en=\"Identify common structural problems.\">Identify common structural problems.</span></li></ul></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section\" id=\"concept-1\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">01</div><h2 data-bn=\"Rectangular table\" data-en=\"Rectangular tables\">Rectangular tables</h2><p data-bn=\"অধিকাংশ analytics rectangular table দিয়ে শুরু হয়: row observation এবং column variable। Header প্রতিটি variable-এর নাম দেয়; column-এর meaning ও data type consistent হওয়া উচিত। Decorative title, merged cell, subtotal row ও multiple header machine analysis কঠিন করে।\" data-en=\"Most analytics begins with a rectangular table: rows are observations and columns are variables. A header names each variable, and each column should have a consistent meaning and data type. Decorative titles, merged cells, subtotal rows, and multiple headers make machine analysis difficult.\">Most analytics begins with a rectangular table: rows are observations and columns are variables. A header names each variable, and each column should have a consistent meaning and data type. Decorative titles, merged cells, subtotal rows, and multiple headers make machine analysis difficult.</p></section><section class=\"tutorial-section\" id=\"concept-2\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">02</div><h2 data-bn=\"Dataset\" data-en=\"Dataset\">Dataset</h2><p data-bn=\"Dataset হলো related data-এর purposeful collection। এটি একটি CSV বা customer, order ও product-এর মতো related table হতে পারে। Data dictionary, source note ও relationship dataset বোঝার অংশ।\" data-en=\"A dataset is a purposeful collection of related data. It may be one CSV file or several related tables such as customers, orders, and products. A data dictionary, source notes, and relationships are part of understanding the dataset even if they are stored separately.\">A dataset is a purposeful collection of related data. It may be one CSV file or several related tables such as customers, orders, and products. A data dictionary, source notes, and relationships are part of understanding the dataset even if they are stored separately.</p></section><section class=\"tutorial-section\" id=\"concept-3\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">03</div><h2 data-bn=\"Wide ও long structure\" data-en=\"Wide and long structures\">Wide and long structures</h2><p data-bn=\"Wide data repeated measure আলাদা column-এ রাখে, যেমন sales_jan ও sales_feb। Long data period-কে variable এবং প্রতিটি measurement-কে row হিসেবে রাখে। Long structure filtering, grouping, charting ও time analysis-এ সহজ।\" data-en=\"Wide data stores repeated measures in separate columns, such as sales_jan and sales_feb. Long data stores period as a variable and each measurement as a row. Long structures are often easier for filtering, grouping, charting, and time-based analysis.\">Wide data stores repeated measures in separate columns, such as sales_jan and sales_feb. Long data stores period as a variable and each measurement as a row. Long structures are often easier for filtering, grouping, charting, and time-based analysis.</p></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section key-terms\" id=\"key-terms\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Vocabulary</div><h2 data-bn=\"গুরুত্বপূর্ণ শব্দ\" data-en=\"Key terms\">Key terms</h2><div class=\"term-grid\"><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Table\" data-en=\"Table\">Table</h3><p data-bn=\"Row ও column-এর rectangular arrangement।\" data-en=\"A rectangular arrangement of rows and columns.\">A rectangular arrangement of rows and columns.</p></article><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Dataset\" data-en=\"Dataset\">Dataset</h3><p data-bn=\"একটি purpose-এর জন্য prepared related data collection।\" data-en=\"A collection of related data prepared for a purpose.\">A collection of related data prepared for a purpose.</p></article><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Schema\" data-en=\"Schema\">Schema</h3><p data-bn=\"Documented structure: field, type, rule ও relationship।\" data-en=\"The documented structure: fields, types, rules, and relationships.\">The documented structure: fields, types, rules, and relationships.</p></article><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Data dictionary\" data-en=\"Data dictionary\">Data dictionary</h3><p data-bn=\"Field, unit, code ও valid value define করা reference।\" data-en=\"A reference that defines fields, units, codes, and valid values.\">A reference that defines fields, units, codes, and valid values.</p></article></div></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section worked-example\" id=\"worked-example\">\n<div class=\"section-kicker\">Example</div><h2 data-bn=\"Spreadsheet export repair\" data-en=\"Repairing a spreadsheet export\">Repairing a spreadsheet export</h2><p class=\"example-context\" data-bn=\"একটি sales sheet-এ row 1-এ title, blank row, merged header, monthly column ও Total row আছে।\" data-en=\"A sales sheet has a title in row 1, blank rows, merged headers, monthly columns, and a Total row.\">A sales sheet has a title in row 1, blank rows, merged headers, monthly columns, and a Total row.</p>\n<ol class=\"worked-steps\"><li><span>1</span><p data-bn=\"Analytical table থেকে presentation-only row সরান।\" data-en=\"Remove presentation-only rows from the analytical table.\">Remove presentation-only rows from the analytical table.</p></li><li><span>2</span><p data-bn=\"Unique name-সহ একটি header row তৈরি করুন।\" data-en=\"Create one header row with unique names.\">Create one header row with unique names.</p></li><li><span>3</span><p data-bn=\"প্রতি row-এ একটি observation রাখুন।\" data-en=\"Keep one observation per row.\">Keep one observation per row.</p></li><li><span>4</span><p data-bn=\"Repeated analysis-এর জন্য monthly column name-কে month variable-এ নিন।\" data-en=\"Move monthly column names into a month variable when repeated analysis is needed.\">Move monthly column names into a month variable when repeated analysis is needed.</p></li><li><span>5</span><p data-bn=\"Raw data-এর মধ্যে subtotal row না রেখে analysis-এ total calculate করুন।\" data-en=\"Calculate totals in analysis rather than storing subtotal rows inside raw data.\">Calculate totals in analysis rather than storing subtotal rows inside raw data.</p></li></ol>\n<div class=\"example-conclusion\"><strong data-bn=\"Conclusion\" data-en=\"Conclusion\">Conclusion</strong><p data-bn=\"Clean table Excel, SQL, Power BI ও Python-এ validate, combine, filter ও reuse করা সহজ।\" data-en=\"A clean table is easier to validate, combine, filter, and reuse across Excel, SQL, Power BI, and Python.\">A clean table is easier to validate, combine, filter, and reuse across Excel, SQL, Power BI, and Python.</p></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section try-it-section\" id=\"try-it\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Try it yourself</div><h2 data-bn=\"ধারণাটি প্র্যাকটিস করুন\" data-en=\"Practice the idea\">Practice the idea</h2><div id=\"tutorial-activity\"></div></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section exercise-section\" id=\"exercises\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Check yourself</div><h2 data-bn=\"Chapter exercise\" data-en=\"Chapter exercises\">Chapter exercises</h2><div id=\"chapter-exercises\"></div><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/exercises/data-foundations/\">Open the complete exercise library →</a></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section recap-section\" id=\"summary\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Summary</div><h2 data-bn=\"যা মনে রাখবেন\" data-en=\"What to remember\">What to remember</h2><ul><li><span data-bn=\"Clean table-এ এক header row ও consistent column থাকে।\" data-en=\"A clean table has one header row and consistent columns.\">A clean table has one header row and consistent columns.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Dataset-এ multiple related table থাকতে পারে।\" data-en=\"A dataset may contain multiple related tables.\">A dataset may contain multiple related tables.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Metadata ও dictionary structure explain করে।\" data-en=\"Metadata and dictionaries explain structure.\">Metadata and dictionaries explain structure.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Long data reusable analysis support করে।\" data-en=\"Long data often supports reusable analysis.\">Long data often supports reusable analysis.</span></li></ul></section>\n<details class=\"tutorial-references\"><summary>Authoritative references</summary><ul><li><a href=\"https://ukdataservice.ac.uk/help/new-users/data-documentation/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">UK Data Service — Data Documentation ↗</a></li><li><a href=\"https://nvlpubs.nist.gov/nistpubs/SpecialPublications/1500-18/NIST.SP.1500-18r2.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">NIST Research Data Framework ↗</a></li></ul></details>\n<div class=\"tutorial-complete-panel\"><div><h2 data-bn=\"পরবর্তী chapter-এর জন্য প্রস্তুত?\" data-en=\"Ready for the next chapter?\">Ready for the next chapter?</h2><p data-bn=\"ধারণাটি explain ও exercise finish করতে পারলে chapter complete mark করুন।\" data-en=\"Mark this chapter complete after you can explain the idea and finish the exercises.\">Mark this chapter complete after you can explain the idea and finish the exercises.</p></div><button class=\"button primary\" id=\"chapter-complete-bottom\" type=\"button\">Mark complete</button></div>\n<nav class=\"tutorial-pager\"><a class=\"tutorial-prev\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/observations-variables-and-values/\"><small>← Previous</small><strong data-bn=\"Observation, Variable ও Value\" data-en=\"Observations, Variables, and Values\">Observations, Variables, and Values</strong></a><a class=\"tutorial-next\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/categorical-and-numerical-data/\"><small>Next →</small><strong data-bn=\"Categorical ও Numerical Data\" data-en=\"Categorical and Numerical Data\">Categorical and Numerical Data</strong></a></nav>\n</article>\n</div></main>","scripts":["/assets/js/tutorial-core.js","/assets/js/tutorial.js"],"inlineScripts":[]}